  "description": "<p>The silicone sink strainer is a flexible and durable solution to prevent clogs in your kitchen or bathroom drains. Designed to catch hair, food scraps, and debris efficiently, this anti-clog hair catcher fits most sinks and wash basins with its wide flower-shaped design.</p>\n <h2>Key features</h2>\n <ul>\n <li>Flexible silicone body adapts to various drain sizes ensuring a snug fit.</li>\n <li>Wide flower-shaped rim covers the drain fully for effective debris filtration.</li>\n <li>Prevents sink clogs by trapping hair, food waste, and other particles.</li>\n <li>Multiple evenly spaced holes allow smooth water flow and drainage.</li>\n <li>Durable, anti-rust silicone material for long-lasting use.</li>\n <li>Center pull knob enables easy removal without touching trapped debris.</li>\n <li>Simple to clean by rinsing or wiping for daily hygiene.</li>\n <li>Non-slip design remains stable under strong water flow.</li>\n </ul>\n <h2>Materials &amp; care</h2>\n <p>Made from premium high-quality silicone that resists deformation and rust. For cleaning, rinse under running water or wipe with a damp cloth to remove trapped waste. Reusable and washable for everyday use.</p>\n <h2>FAQ</h2>\n <dl>\n <dt>Q1: What sizes of drains does this silicone sink strainer fit?</dt>\n <dd>A: Its flexible silicone body adjusts and fits most standard kitchen and bathroom sink drains.</dd>\n <dt>Q2: How does the drain hair catcher prevent clogging?</dt>\n <dd>A: It traps hair, food scraps, and debris before they enter the drain, keeping pipes clear.</dd>\n <dt>Q3: Is it easy to clean the silicone drain filter?</dt>\n <dd>A: Yes, simply rinse it under water or wipe it clean to remove trapped waste.</dd>\n <dt>Q4: Can this strainer be used in showers or bathtubs?</dt>\n <dd>A: Yes, it’s suitable for shower and bathtub drains as well.</dd>\n <dt>Q5: Is the material safe for kitchen use?</dt>\n <dd>A: Absolutely, the silicone is durable, non-rusting, and safe for food-related areas.</dd>\n </dl>\n<!-- dims:start -->\n<div class=\"product-dimensions\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong>Product Dimensions</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Length</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">20 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Width</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">14 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Height</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">3 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Weight</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">68 g</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- dims:end -->",
